{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちぃちゃん みなみ2人とも大好き♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメント！\n正直読むの怖かったけど\n読ませていただきました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに皆あたたかくて...涙が溢れだしちゃっいました......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも素敵な皆さんと出会えた事に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の前では、いつも笑顔でいたいのに\n弱音も言っていいよって言ってくれる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろうって言ってくれる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの存在が薄れる事はないよって言ってくれる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部大切な言葉\n凄いパワーになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部 全部...大切に心に残して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと皆を大切にできるような人になりたいから、これからもいろんな事を勉強していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなまあやをこれからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな生駒ちゃん！総選挙に\n挑戦する姿に凄く尊敬してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーは皆個性的で、\n尊敬する所が沢山あるグループで\n皆仲良しで、\nファンのファミリーの方も優しくて\n皆で乃木坂だな〜って思わせてくれる素敵なファミリーだと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆で坂を登っていけるように頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の全握は、なあちゃんとです♪♪\n(≧∇≦)\nなあちゃんファンの皆さま宜しくお願いしますm(__)m楽しみに待っています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやファミリーの皆さま...逢えるかな〜ワクワク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます(//∇//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も皆が健康で笑顔でありますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にまあやの昔やってたあるある話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある日喉がいたくて病院でトローチを貰って、\nそれが美味しかったのをきっかけに\n痛くもないのに喉がいたいと嘘をついてトローチをもらってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだれか共感して貰えないかなぁ......(。>д<)！？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/05/16/6833475/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}